  },
  {
    slug: 'lic-jeevan-labh-736-returns',
    title: 'LIC Jeevan Labh (736) Returns: Premium, Bonus & Maturity on ₹10 Lakh SA',
    desc: 'Jeevan Labh (736) limited-pay endowment explained: 16/21/25-year terms paying 10/15/16 years, maturity = SA + reversionary bonus + FAB, an illustrative ₹10 lakh / ~₹22.4 lakh example at declared rates (~5.8% zone), and who the plan suits.'
  },
  {
    slug: 'lic-jeevan-umang-745-income-reality',
